  "projectUrl": "https://docs.ppnsys.com/",
  "published": "2026-11-19T16:39:15.137Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Pipeline-Oriented Architecture: Unified Serialization, Compression, and Security into a cohesive Codec stack.\n- High-Performance Framing: Integrated DataFrames (PacketBase, FrameBase) and structured ProtocolFrames for unified control and data transport.\n- Advanced Cryptography: Hardened AEAD engines (Chacha20Poly1305/Salsa20Poly1305) and high-speed X25519 key exchange.\n- Optimized Serialization: Refined LiteSerializer with source-generated codecs for complex types and fast unmanaged paths.\n- Efficient Compression: Integrated LZ4 block encoders with custom memory pool support to minimize GC pressure.",
